      "body": "## Vercel Configuration Setup\n\n- [ ] Update vercel.json to add rewrites configuration for SPA routing\n- [ ] Add .vercelignore file for cleaner deployments\n- [ ] Verify package.json scripts (already correct)\n- [ ] Test and validate changes\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT ORIGINAL PROMPT -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> GitHub Tasks to Fix Your echo-forge Project\n> 1. Add/Update vercel.json in your repo root\n> Create or modify vercel.json with:\n> {\n>   \"buildCommand\": \"npm run build\",\n>   \"outputDirectory\": \"dist\",\n>   \"devCommand\": \"npm run dev\",\n>   \"installCommand\": \"npm install\",\n>   \"framework\": \"vite\",\n>   \"rewrites\": [\n>     {\n>       \"source\": \"/(.*)\",\n>       \"destination\": \"/index.html\"\n>     }\n>   ]\n> }\n> 2. Verify your package.json has correct scripts\n> Make sure you have:\n> {\n>   \"scripts\": {\n>     \"dev\": \"vite\",\n>     \"build\": \"vite build\",\n>     \"preview\": \"vite preview\"\n>   }\n> }\n> 3. (Optional) Add .vercelignore\n> To keep deployments clean:\n> node_modules\n> .git\n> *.log\n> .DS_Store\n> .env.local\n> 4. Commit and Push\n> git add vercel.json\n> git commit -m \"fix: configure Vercel for Vite framework\"\n> git push origin main\n> Vercel will automatically:\n> Detect the new configuration\n> Redeploy with correct framework settings\n> Enable proper analytics\n> 5. Enable Analytics (After Deploy)\n> Go to Vercel dashboard → Your project → Analytics tab → Enable Web Analytics\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT TIPS -->\n---\n\n💬 We'd love your input! Share your thoughts on Copilot coding agent in our [2 minute survey](https://gh.io/copilot-coding-agent-survey).\n",
